# Delivery path
## Mermaid flowchart

<<mermaid>>
flowchart LR
    A[Author] --> B[SlideLang AST]
    B --> C[Renderer]
    C --> D[HTML]
    C --> E[PDF]
    C --> F[PPTX]
    D --> G[Review]
    E --> G
    F --> G
<<end>>

---

# Service collaboration
## PlantUML sequence

<<plantuml>>
@startuml
actor Author
participant SlideLang
participant Renderer
database Assets

Author -> SlideLang: build validation fixture
SlideLang -> Renderer: AST + resolved theme
Renderer -> Assets: render rich elements
Assets --> Renderer: themed images
Renderer --> Author: presentation output
@enduml
<<end>>

---

# Formula rendering
## MathJax output

The quality gate compares the same formula in browser and offline paths.

<<math>>
E = mc^2
label: "eq:quality"
<<end>>

